---
import PublicLayout from '../../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME } from '../../config';
const samples = [
 {month:'NOVEMBER', title:'Our Family Ownership Plan', benefit:'Less reminding. More ownership.', detail:'Hand off one whole job with a clear owner, a time, and a definition of finished.', url:'/club/worksheet-generator/', label:'See the November plan', shade:'#e7ece5', number:'01'},
 {month:'JANUARY', title:'Our Family Habit Cards', benefit:'Smoother mornings, fewer reminders.', detail:'Simple cues that help children know what to do next without another chart for Mom to manage.',url:'/preview/january-habit-cards', label:'See the January cards',shade:'#cddde1',number:'02'},
 {month:'MAY', title:'Our Family Summer Rhythm', benefit:'More freedom. Less directing.',detail:'A flexible summer rhythm and practical activity ideas children can follow when school ends.',url:'/club/may-preview/',label:'See the May rhythm',shade:'#f1ede4',number:'03'}
];
const faqs = [
 ['What exactly comes in the mail?', 'Our planned subscription includes one personalized 8.5 × 11 family organization tool each month, with a short note from Megan. We are still testing the final paper and mailing format.'],
 ['Will I have to put the plan together?', 'No. We want to prepare the plan using a few details about your household. You can review suggested assignments or make changes, but the default should be ready to use. Automated fulfillment is still being tested.'],
 ['What ages is this for?', 'The tools are designed to adjust to the ages and abilities of the people in your household, including participating adults.'],
 ['Is this different from the wall calendar?', 'Yes. The calendar shows the week’s plan. The Club helps family members share responsibility for carrying it out. Either can be used on its own.'],
 ['What if we miss a month?', 'Nothing to catch up on. Each month’s tool is meant to stand alone.'],
 ['Can I subscribe today?', 'Not yet. We are testing personalized printing, mailing, and billing before opening enrollment. You can contact us about early access.']
];
---

<PublicLayout fullTitle={`Organized Family Club · ${BRAND_NAME}`} description="Less for Mom to manage. More for the family to own. One personalized family organization tool, prepared for you and delivered monthly." indexable={false} chrome={false} width="full" tracking={false}>
<div class="ofc">
 <header class="ofc-nav">
  <a href="/" aria-label="Organized Mom Collective home" class="ofc-logo"><img src="/brand/omc-badge.png" alt="" width="52" height="52"/><span>Organized Family Club</span></a>
  <nav aria-label="Page navigation"><a href="#inside">What you get</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a><a href="/club/dashboard" class="ofc-member-link">Member kits ↗</a></nav>
 </header>
 <section class="ofc-hero" aria-labelledby="ofc-heading">
  <div class="ofc-hero-copy">
   <p class="ofc-eyebrow">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · MONTHLY FAMILY MAIL</p>
   <h1 id="ofc-heading">Less for Mom to manage. <em>More for the family to own.</em></h1>
   <p class="ofc-lead">We make the plan. Your family makes it happen.</p>
   <p>One beautifully prepared, personalized family tool delivered to your mailbox each month. So everyone can start taking more responsibility without you having to figure it all out.</p>
   <div class="ofc-hero-cta"><a href="#inside" class="ofc-button">See what comes in the mail <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
   <p class="ofc-availability">Enrollment is not open yet. <a href="/support">Ask about early access →</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="ofc-hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a flat envelope holding the monthly family plan">
   <div class="ofc-postmark">ONE FAMILY. ONE USEFUL TOOL.</div>
   <div class="ofc-mail-back"></div>
   <div class="ofc-paper ofc-paper-back"><span>PERSONALIZED FOR YOUR FAMILY</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
   <div class="ofc-paper ofc-paper-front"><small>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · NOVEMBER</small><strong>Our family.<br /><em>Our team.</em></strong><div class="ofc-paper-line">ONE JOB · ONE OWNER</div><div class="ofc-paper-line">A READY-TO-USE PLAN</div><div class="ofc-paper-line">MADE FOR YOUR FAMILY</div><span>PREPARED FOR YOU</span></div>
   <div class="ofc-envelope"><span>GOOD THINGS COME IN THE MAIL.</span></div>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-intro" aria-labelledby="ofc-problem">
  <p class="ofc-eyebrow">SOUND FAMILIAR?</p>
  <h2 id="ofc-problem">Everyone helps. <em>But you're still managing everything.</em></h2>
  <p>You remember what needs to happen. You make the plans. You assign the jobs. You remind everyone to follow through.</p>
  <p>Even when your family pitches in, you're the one keeping it all running. And most organization tools give you one more thing to set up.</p>
  <p><strong>What if someone did that part for you?</strong></p>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-solution" aria-labelledby="ofc-solution-heading">
  <div class="ofc-solution-copy">
   <p class="ofc-eyebrow">ONE LITTLE ENVELOPE. ONE LESS THING TO FIGURE OUT.</p>
   <h2 id="ofc-solution-heading">We make the plan. <em>Your family makes it happen.</em></h2>
   <p>Every month, we tackle one real family challenge with a practical tool prepared for your household.</p>
   <p>Not a blank worksheet. Not another complicated system. Names, realistic responsibilities, and clear next steps already worked out.</p>
   <p><strong>Open it. Put it to use. Let your family take it from there.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="ofc-solution-photo"><img src="/images/club/club-dad-son-dishes.webp" alt="Father and son sharing responsibility for dishes at the kitchen sink" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800"/></figure>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-demo" aria-labelledby="ofc-demo-heading">
  <p class="ofc-eyebrow">WHAT SHARING THE LOAD CAN LOOK LIKE</p>
  <h2 id="ofc-demo-heading">Less reminding. <em>More ownership.</em></h2>
  <div class="ofc-demo-grid">
   <div class="ofc-demo-panel"><span>BEFORE</span><p>“Can someone unload the dishwasher?”</p><p>“Did you finish cleaning up?”</p><p>“Who's supposed to do this?”</p></div>
   <div class="ofc-demo-panel ofc-demo-after"><span>WITH A PREPARED FAMILY PLAN</span><p><strong>Andrew:</strong> Unload the dishwasher after breakfast.</p><p><strong>Philip:</strong> Clear the dinner table.</p><p><strong>Dad:</strong> Own Wednesday dinner, start to finish.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="ofc-demo-caption">Illustrative household example. Actual assignments are tailored to the family.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-months" id="inside" aria-labelledby="ofc-months-heading">
  <div class="ofc-section-head"><p class="ofc-eyebrow">A PEEK INSIDE THE CLUB</p><h2 id="ofc-months-heading">Real solutions for <em>real family life.</em></h2><p>One useful tool for each month's everyday challenge. Here are three examples of what we're building.</p></div>
  <div class="ofc-month-grid">
   {samples.map((m)=><article class="ofc-month" style={`--month-color:${m.shade}`}>
    <div class="ofc-month-art"><div class="ofc-month-art-meta"><span>{m.month}</span><span>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</span></div><div class="ofc-art-sheet ofc-art-ownership"><p>OUR FAMILY <em>{m.title.replace('Our Family ','').toUpperCase()}</em></p><div><strong>{m.benefit}</strong><span>PREPARED FOR YOUR FAMILY</span></div><div><strong>ONE USEFUL TOOL</strong><span>READY TO USE</span></div></div><div class="ofc-art-caption">ILLUSTRATIVE PREVIEW</div></div>
    <div class="ofc-month-copy"><p class="ofc-month-eyebrow">{m.benefit}</p><h3>{m.title}</h3><p>{m.detail}</p><a href={m.url} class="ofc-text-link">{m.label} →</a></div>
   </article>)}
  </div>
  <p class="ofc-disclaimer">These are working product previews using sample households. Printing and fulfillment are still being validated.</p>
  <p class="ofc-month-summary">And that's just the beginning. From school mornings to family dinners, each month offers a fresh way to share the load. No catching up and no extra homework.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-method" id="how" aria-labelledby="ofc-how-heading">
  <div class="ofc-method-copy"><p class="ofc-eyebrow">SIMPLE FROM THE START</p><h2 id="ofc-how-heading">We do the prep work. <em>You get the good part.</em></h2>
   <div class="ofc-method-steps">
    <div><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us about your family once.</h3><p>Just a few details like names and ages, so each resource fits your household.</p></div></div>
    <div><span>02</span><div><h3>We prepare your monthly tool.</h3><p>We suggest practical plans and age-appropriate responsibilities. Review or adjust them only if you want.</p></div></div>
    <div><span>03</span><div><h3>Happy mail arrives.</h3><p>Your personalized printed plan arrives ready to use, with a digital version for reviewing or reprinting.</p></div></div>
   </div><p><strong>No printer needed. No blank pages. No monthly homework.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="ofc-method-photo"><img src="/images/site/calendar-cutout-720.webp" alt="Organized Mom Collective weekly wall calendar" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1058"/><figcaption>One small step toward a home that runs together.</figcaption></figure>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-calendar" aria-labelledby="ofc-calendar-heading">
  <img src="/images/site/calendar-cutout-720.webp" width="720" height="1058" loading="lazy" alt="Organized Mom Collective wall calendar"/>
  <div><p class="ofc-eyebrow">GREAT TOGETHER. USEFUL APART.</p><h2 id="ofc-calendar-heading">The calendar shows the plan. <em>The Club helps your family own it.</em></h2><p>The wall calendar helps everyone see what's happening. The Club helps everyone share responsibility for getting it done.</p><p>They work beautifully together, but you don't need the calendar to enjoy the Club.</p><a href="/calendar" class="ofc-text-link">Explore the wall calendar →</a></div>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-offer" aria-labelledby="ofc-offer-heading">
  <p class="ofc-eyebrow">YOUR MONTHLY FAMILY MAIL</p>
  <h2 id="ofc-offer-heading">A little less on your shoulders. <em>Every month.</em></h2>
  <p>One personalized printed family tool, delivered to your home, plus a digital version to review or reprint. One monthly problem. One useful solution.</p>
  <p class="ofc-offer-price">$6.39 <span>/ month</span> <small>or $59/year</small></p>
  <p class="ofc-offer-note">Proposed pricing, subject to fulfillment testing. Enrollment has not opened.</p>
  <a href="/support" class="ofc-button">Ask about early access →</a>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-family" aria-labelledby="ofc-family-heading">
  <img src="/images/site/mark-megan-family-story-1200.webp" width="1200" height="1200" alt="The Organized Mom Collective founding family outdoors" loading="lazy"/>
  <div><p class="ofc-eyebrow">FROM OUR FAMILY TO YOURS</p><h2 id="ofc-family-heading">Organized moms <em>shouldn't have to do it all.</em></h2><p>We believe an organized home isn't one where Mom has everything under control. It's one where the whole family learns to notice, pitch in, and care for each other.</p><p>That's why we created the Club. Not to give Mom another system to manage, but to do some of the planning and preparation for her.</p><p><strong>Organized moms raise organized families.</strong></p><p><em>Mark &amp; Megan</em></p></div>
 </section>
 <section class="ofc-faq" id="questions" aria-labelledby="ofc-faq-heading"><p class="ofc-eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS</p><h2 id="ofc-faq-heading">Before you join</h2><div>{faqs.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section class="ofc-close" aria-labelledby="ofc-close-heading"><p class="ofc-eyebrow">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</p><h2 id="ofc-close-heading">You don't have to organize <em>everything yourself.</em></h2><p class="ofc-close-lead">A little help from us. A little more ownership from your family.</p><p class="ofc-notice">We're getting ready to open enrollment. Personalized printing and mailing are still in testing.</p><div class="ofc-close-actions"><a class="ofc-button" href="/support">Ask about early access →</a><a class="ofc-text-link" href="#inside">See the monthly tools →</a></div></section>
 <footer class="ofc-footer"><a href="/">Organized Mom Collective</a><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Organized Mom Collective</span><a href="/support">Support</a></footer>
</div>
<style>
